  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Principles Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting growth, security and international relations, the Voluntary Principles Initiative (VPI) is a multi-stakeholder initiative bringing together companies, governments and NGOs to address security related human rights abuses and violations in the energy and extractives sector.  It promotes a set of principles that guide companies on providing security for their operations while respecting human rights. The funding promotes human rights by addressing complex security and human rights issues globally, enabling international compliance / standards and economic growth in ODA eligible countries.</narrative>
  </description>
